{{Skill infobox|id=Envy}}

'''Envy''' is a skill that grants an [[aura]] that grants added [[chaos damage]] for the [[attack]]s and [[spell]]s of the caster and their nearby [[ally|allies]]. Envy is not available as a [[skill gem]] - it can only be granted by [[modifier]]s on [[equipment]].

==Skill mechanics and interactions==
Envy is affected by [[support gem]]s socketed into the item that grants the skill, regardless of whether the [[socket]]s are linked. As it is not an actual [[skill gem]], it cannot be supported by {{il|Empower Support}}, {{il|Enhance Support}}, and {{il|Enlighten Support}}.

If Envy is granted by an [[item]] with [[socket]]s, {{il|Generosity Support}} and {{il|Awakened Generosity Support}} can be socketed into the item to support Envy.

Envy is an aura and scales with aura modifiers.

==Acquisition==
This skill can only be gained indirectly through certain items or modifiers:

* [[Runesmithing]] [[enchantment]]: {{c|enchanted|Grants Level 1 Envy Skill}}
*  {{il|page=Aul's Uprising (All Attributes)}}:  {{ml|GrantsEnvyUnique__2|display=stat_text}}
* {{il|Grasping Mail}} drop-only modifier: {{ml|BreachBodyGrantsEnvy1|display=stat_text}}
* [[Elder]]-influenced [[amulet]] modifier: {{ml|GrantsEnvyAuraUber1|display=stat_text}}
*  {{il|Severed in Sleep}}: {{ml|GrantsEnvyUnique__1|display=stat_text}}
*  {{il|United in Dream}}: {{ml|GrantsEnvyUnique__1|display=stat_text}}
* [[Malevolent Strands]] ([[Legacy of Phrecia]]): {{c|mod|Grants Level 15 Envy Skill}}, {{c|mod|Envy has no Reservation}}

